\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Overall information flow of the proposed embodied AI system. The VLM core (centre) receives the scene image and user request, produces a \texttt {call\_robot()} tool call and a confirmation reply, and exposes layer-20 hidden states to the SAE module (right). The execution module (left) dispatches servo commands to the robot hardware.}}{12}{figure.caption.9}%
